# Local state and per-operator inputs. State names every resource in your
# tenancy and is not shared through this repo; move it to a remote backend if
# more than one person deploys this.
#
# `.terraform.lock.hcl` is deliberately NOT ignored: it pins the provider
# versions every operator resolves, which is the same reproducibility argument
# as `Cargo.lock` and `flake.lock`.
.terraform/
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.*
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
